WEBVTT

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.950
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.410
<i>Gabumon.</i>

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.740
<i>This Digimon is Yamato-san's partner.</i>

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.740
LEVEL: ROOKIE

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.000
TYPE: REPTILE

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.750
<i>The unique long horn is optimized
for close-range battles.</i>

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.250
SPECIAL MOVE: PETIT FIRE

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.620
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.340
<i>The fur coat being worn seems
to be Garurumon's.</i>

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.460
<i>I wonder how the inside looks?</i>

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.050
<i>Maybe I'll take a peek one day.</i>

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.260
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.310
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.480
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.700
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.580
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.470
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.310
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:14.110
<i>To avenge Orgemon
and to protect their friends,</i>

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:19.610
<i>Taichi and Greymon awaken a new power
to evolve into an Ultimate Digimon,</i>

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.200
<i>and defeat Metaltyranomon with it.</i>

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:41.140
<i>However, their next path was blocked
by a swamp emitting dark miasma.</i>

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:45.140
<i>The six children who finally got together
split up into two teams</i>

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.430
<i>and set out for the Holy Digimon.</i>

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.770
THE WOLF STANDING ATOP THE DESERT

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.740
Geez, who even suggested drawing names?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:01.780
You, Mimi.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.080
This area's a little cold.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.040
And besides,

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.120
I can't climb like that...

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.630
Mimi-chan, hurry and come up too!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.960
No way!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.420
You have too much energy!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.010
But the members and route were picked
randomly, so isn't it fair?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.850
We're going ahead!

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.770
Oh, no fair!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.020
Hey, isn't this a detour?

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.270
It's not a detour!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:37.150
<i>If we're taking the north side
to avoid that dangerous swamp,</i>

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.030
<i>the fastest route is to go through here.</i>

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.280
The Holy Digimon is waiting!

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.660
C'mon, let's go, Mimi.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.660
What? What? What?!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.290
Isn't this easier?

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.330
Definitely!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:53.170
Palmon, you're the best! I love you!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.420
This is amazing!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:03.760
We might be able
to gain new information again!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:07.810
I wonder... how it looks inside...

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.440
I'm so glad Birdramon was with us!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.490
Please hurry, Birdramon!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.070
Leave it to me!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.580
Something's coming!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.450
What?

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:34.710
SANDYAMMAMON

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.710
Dust devils!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.220
Hang on! We're gonna cut through it!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.220
We're gonna get sucked in!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.220
Let's land once!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.940
Gabumon, here they come!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:02.740
Yeah!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.720
What's going on?

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.550
A-An ally?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.010
Ahh! There it is!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:36.230
KYAROMON

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.230
Those are Kyaromon!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.650
Ahh! Not again!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.120
Piyomon!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.040
Okay!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.040
Gomamon! Us too!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.250
Of course!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.750
Magical Fire!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.170
Marching Fishes!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.490
Gabumon Evolution!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.090
Garurumon!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.220
Kyaromon!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.390
You're safe now.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:10.820
This guy's reading our moves
from under the sand!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.330
Garurumon! The base of the claw!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.500
Go on ahead!

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:21.870
Okay!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:30.670
Garurumon!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.180
Yeah!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.190
Are you hurt, Gabumon?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.780
I'm fine. But...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.700
That power...
Could be an Ultimate Digimon.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.420
Hey!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:13.050
Ohh, you're human?
This is my first time seeing them.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:18.720
Don't worry, they are the ones
who saved Kyaromon.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.260
BEARMON / LABRAMON

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.310
NEAMON

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.310
My name is Neamon.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.810
Wow, I'm surprised you were able
to escape Scorpiomon.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.480
Scorpiomon... that Digimon from earlier?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.950
This place is
Scorpiomon's territory now...

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:38.450
<i>You saw the Sandyammamon
that made those dust devils, right?</i>

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:43.330
<i>Even they will become Scorpiomon's food
if they're captured.</i>

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.840
Many of our friends have too...

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:54.340
I appreciate you saving Kyaromon.
Thank you.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.720
Y-You're welcome!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.350
By the way, are all of you going as well?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:04.980
To Leomon's place?

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.060
Leomon?

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.860
Oh, was I wrong?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.360
We're looking for the Holy Digimon.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.820
Holy?

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.530
What kind of Digimon is Leomon?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.870
Currently, there are vicious Digimon
that are enwrapped in dark miasma

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.500
going wild all over this continent.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.830
Leomon seems to be leading an army
to fight those Digimon.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.670
A resistance... you mean.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:37.050
They probably have nothing to do
with who you're looking for.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.890
Are all of you going to fight too?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:44.850
Weak Digimon
like us cannot possibly fight...

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:49.230
But if we go to Leomon's place,
we will be protected.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.270
That's why we want to cross the desert.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.940
<i>But there's that Scorpiomon in the desert!</i>

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.780
<i>That's right!
Sandyammamon are in the sky too!</i>

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.790
<i>Crossing that is way too risky!</i>

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:09.040
<i>Even if we stay here, we will eventually
be caught and become their prey.</i>

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.960
That is why we decided
to go no matter what it takes.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.670
For these ones' sakes...

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.760
If that's the case,
let's go with them too.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.550
You aren't gonna ask me?

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.430
There, there.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.310
It'll slow us down if we add
more than necessary to our party.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:29.350
We don't have room for that now.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.690
Yamato...

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.860
We have our own mission to accomplish.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.860
Did you forget what Izumi told you guys?

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.950
<i>The power failure in Tokyo has dragged on
and all utilities have stopped now.</i>

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.370
<i>Everyone can't survive,
so they're fleeing the city...</i>

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:52.710
<i>On top of that, the damages are continuing
to spread to the entire metropolitan area.</i>

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.960
We're the only ones
who can stop this situation.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.930
Of course, we're worried about home too...

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:04.510
But we can't just ignore someone in need
right in front of us!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.810
You think you can protect this many?

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:15.190
Thank you, humans.
We appreciate the thought.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.740
But don't worry about us.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:21.320
No, we'll go with all of you.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.240
Yeah!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.660
Um... they've both got a good point.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.200
Joe, what do you wanna do?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.450
Er...

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.830
Do whatever you want.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.040
Gabumon, let's go.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:37.000
Uhh, wait!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.630
It's okay, Joe Senpai.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:40.510
But!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.840
And you, Joe?

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:51.890
I'll do it!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.400
I can't just abandon them either!

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:57.020
That's the spirit! That's my Joe!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.280
Thank you...

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.740
Yeah, leave it to us!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.750
Aren't you going to tell everyone?

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.460
About yourself?

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.540
If you don't tell everyone,
they're not gonna understand.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:21.670
I don't think you need
to take it all up on yourself.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.220
I have you.

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.600
That's all I need.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.190
Here we go, Piyomon!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.320
Piyomon Evolution!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.440
Birdramon!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:41.940
Gomamon!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.610
Gomamon Evolution!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.700
Ikkakumon!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.450
Wow!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.080
We'll lure those Sandyammamon away!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.420
Senpai and Ikkakumon,
take care of Neamon's group!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.040
Got it!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.670
Now, hop on!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.840
We'll protect you
until we get through the desert!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.290
I hope this goes okay...

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.500
Sora, here they come!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.210
Let's go, Birdramon!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.130
Okay!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.590
They've brought more of them!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.430
We're gonna back up Birdramon too!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.760
Okay!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.050
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.690
The dust devils are going to swallow us!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.400
Ikkakumon, get back!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.030
Everyone, get off!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.780
Ikkakumon!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.260
Oh no!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.800
Ikkakumon's trapped!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.300
Ikkakumon!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.650
We're gonna shake this guy off!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.150
They're making dust devils again!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.820
What do we do, Birdramon?!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.120
Hold on tight!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.580
Birdramon!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:12.720
We did it!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.070
Piyomon, are you okay?

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.400
S-Somehow...

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.910
Ikkakumon, Sora and Piyomon!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.710
Are you all right?!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.600
Go!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.100
Garurumon!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.530
Fire!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.510
SCORPIOMON

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:41.770
Fox Fire!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.790
I knew it, an Ultimate Digimon!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.710
<i>I have you.</i>

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.090
<i>That's all I need.</i>

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:17.140
But we can't just ignore someone in need
right in front of us!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.020
You think you can protect this many?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.800
Garurumon!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.140
Garurumon...

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.510
Super Evolution!

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.660
Weregarurumon!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:21.740
WEREGARURUMON

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.500
Our new power...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.080
Weregarurumon...

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.250
That's... an Ultimate Digimon!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:49.480
Wow!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.510
Kaiser Nail!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.020
Weregarurumon...

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.120
Thank you, humans!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:56.210
I hope you're able to see Leomon safely!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.840
Thank you for coming back.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:07.390
If I left, you guys would make a move.
As a result, they'd make a move as well.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:11.230
That's what you were aiming for?!
We were bait?!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.810
Well, let's just leave it at that...

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.980
I have a little brother.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.740
His name is... Takeru.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.990
He lives in Tokyo.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.120
What?

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.660
<i>I don't know
if he's already evacuated the area</i>

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:33.040
<i>or if he's still within the dark city...</i>

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:37.500
<i>But his heart must be filled
with fear right now.</i>

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.250
<i>When I think about that...</i>

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:41.880
there's no way I can stay put.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.390
That's why you were rushing?

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.890
I don't care to know why we were chosen.

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:55.020
As long as my brother can live in peace
and I can make that happen, I'll do it.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.730
Thank you for telling us!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.820
I'm so happy to know you better!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.530
In return, let me tell you about myself!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.820
We've heard it already...

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.660
He hasn't yet!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.330
We're in a rush!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.950
Aren't you glad you told them?

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.000
Maybe.

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:27.430
Hey, Koshiro! We're going ahead!

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.930
Wait one moment, just a little longer...

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.930
Is it that interesting? That wall?

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:36.560
If we analyze it,
it'll come in handy one day.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.770
He's forgetting the objective.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:43.690
If we keep taking pictures of all this,
we'll never get through here.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.450
Palmon, can you read this?

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:49.370
Huh?

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.830
No way!

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.290
What is it?!

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.710
Mimi-chan!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.630
Palmon!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.260
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:11.260
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.770
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.110
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:30.950
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.080
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:39.080
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.510
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:47.510
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.590
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.590
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>ima nara kitto sora mo toberu kara</i>

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:04.270
<i>Mimi and Palmon venture
the underground ruins!</i>

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.820
<i>When they're in danger,</i>

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:09.200
<i>an encounter with
a kindhearted Digimon causes a miracle!</i>

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:12.450
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Lilimon Blooms"</i>

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.200
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
